index 000000000..15093dd08
--- /dev/null
+++ b/newsfragments/genesys_infra_red_option.backend
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+genesys: Added the --infra-red option, which delivers the infrared plane of a transparency scan as a second frame; tested on the Plustek OpticFilm 8200i SE.
